ean we have an idea  I guess of what is to come but not in  relation today this stuff because it  hadn't been written at the time of that  information being leaked out so all the  people that annoyingly posted that crap  all season long and all offseason this  is our chance for those of us who  haven't been talking about it to think  about what's going to go on in the  future so give it a like if you enjoy  the video check back all this week  because hopefully this next episode  come out early and we'll be able to have  proper amount of hype built up into the  lead up of it make sure you subscribe to  my channel and turn on notifications if  you haven't done that yet definitely  tell me your thoughts in the comments  following with me on Twitter you can  talk to me over there and my other  social media accounts thanks for  watching guys I'll talk to you soon  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  there is only one war that matters and  it is here
 

